<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FIRSTPLUS started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FIRSTPLUS started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities analyst Jennifer Scutti said she initiated coverage of FIRSTPLUS Financial Group Inc with a buy rating and a $50 12-month price target.</p>
<p>-- set earnings estimates of $3.05 for fiscal 1997 and $3.95 for fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- stock closed Tuesday at 39-23/32.</p>
</text>
